    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Hamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Kushi walī ise",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ise:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, ise nkūlūgenji wakwe.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wa ng'wa Nimulodi, ūyo walī wa kwandya ū mu sī kūbiza munhū wa būdūla būtaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ng'wenūyo walī ng'hīīgi nhaale ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA; h'ī nguno yene lūlīho na lūsumo lūhayile gīkī, “Gīt'umo alī Nimulodi, ng'hīīgi nhaale kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būsugi wakwe walī būkūbanīgije sī ningī, Babeli, Eleki, Akadi, na Kaline ya mu sī ya Shinaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho alī mu sī yenīyo akajūdima sī ya Ashulu, ūzenga ko mizengo ya Ninawi, Lehoboti-ili, Kala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Leseeni, ūyo gūlī ha gatī ya Ninawi na Kala, nīyo hū nzengo ū ntaale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahīvī, Baaliki, Basinai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalivadi, Bazemali na Bahamati. Hanuma ya henaho ī ng'anda ja Bakanaani jikasambaala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mbīmbī jabo jūgalīha, jūkikuumya na sī ya Sidoni, hihī na Geela kūja Gaza. Hūna kūjīīlīla Sodoma, Gomola, Adima, na Zeboimu, kūjūkashika Lasha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A benaba h'a banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Hamu, ūmo bikalīlaga ū mu sī ja mahanga gabo, kūlondeela ng'anda na ndīmi jabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Shemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Shemu, ū nkūlūye wa ng'wa Yafeti, nang'hwe akabyalīlwa bitūnja. Hū ng'wene ū nkūlūgenji wa banhū ba būbyīle bo ng'wa Ebeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī litogolo lya sī īyo bikalaga lyalī līkūbanīgije mapandī ga kwandīja Mesha kūjīlīīla kīya, kū magūlya ga sī ya Sefali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shenīshi h'ī shibyalīlwe sha bitūnja ba ng'wa Shemu, kūlenganīla nū mumo jalī ng'anda na ndīmi jabo, ūmo bikalīlaga mu sī ja mahanga gabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pyī ī shenīshi shibyalīlwe sha bitūnja ba ng'wa Noa, gīt'ūmo jalī jiihelelile ī ng'anda jabo, ū mu mahanga gabo. A mahanga ga banhū gakasambaala pye a hose ū mu sī kwandīja mu banhū benaba, kwīngīīla aho lyabīta ī lihūūma lya minzī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
